<div class=\"upper-line\">It is important to smile and keep the conversation light and humorous.</div>\n      <div class=\"upper-line\"><strong>Step 4:Post-reading</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"upper-line\">Role play: supposing that you are in a new class. And please make a small</div>\n      <div class=\"upper-line\">talk with your classmates.</div>\n      <div class=\"upper-line\"><strong>Step 5:Summary and homework</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"upper-line\">Summary: Make a summary with the whole class.</div>\n      <div class=\"upper-line\">Homework: Finish the exercises on the book and share what we have</div>\n      <div class=\"upper-line\">learned with your parents.</div>\n      <div class=\"upper-line\"><strong>5.Blackboard design</strong></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"blackboard\">\n      <div class=\"board-title\">Small talk</div>\n      <div class=\"board-q1\">Q1:What's the small talk?</div>\n      <div class=\"board-q2\">Q2:What's the important thing about small talk?</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"script-title\">逐字稿</div>\n\n    <section class=\"script\">\n      <div class=\"script-line\">\n        <strong>Greeting:</strong> <span class=\"under\">Hello, everyone, nice to see you again. How was everything</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"script-line under\">going? Great? Not bad? I'm so glad to hear that.</div>\n      <div class=\"script-line\"><strong>Warm up:</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"script-line under\">How about singing a song to cheer you up? &lt;We are the world.&gt;</div>\n      <div class=\"script-line lyrics\">We are the world, we are the children. We are the ones who make a</div>\n      <div class=\"script-line lyrics\">brighter day. So let's start giving.</div>\n      <div class=\"script-line under\">OK, are you happy now? It's time for class.</div>\n\n      <div class=\"lead-in\">\n        <div class=\"script-line\"><strong>Lead-in:</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"script-line under\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;I watched a very interesting video and now I want to share it with</div>\n        <div class=\"script-line under\">you.<span class=\"red\">(视频导入)</span> Do you want to see it? Well, let's look at the PPT. <span class=\"red\">(手指屏幕)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"script-line under\">What can you see in the video?</div>\n        <div class=\"script-line under\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Yes, some people. Who are they? Yes, they are some businessmen.</div>\n        <div class=\"script-line under\">What are they doing? Right, they are chatting with one another before</div>\n        <div class=\"script-line under\">having a meeting, and the topic they are talking about is very funny, so the</div>\n        <div class=\"script-line under\">atmosphere is relaxing, right? We call it small talk. Do you know why they</div>\n        <div class=\"script-line under\">do so before such an important and serious meeting? <span class=\"red\">(手指屏幕)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"script-line under\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Well, today we will learn something about this. We will learn small</div>\n        <div class=\"script-line under\">talk.<span class=\"red\">(板书标题)</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
